<section class="team-member-page">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="navigation-breadcrumb">
            <a href="?page=our-team&lang=en" class="back-link">
                <span class="back-arrow">←</span> 
                Back to Team            </a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="member-container">
            <div class="member-profile-card">
                <div class="member-header">
                    <div class="member-title-section">
                        <h1 class="member-name">Asaf Shaul</h1>
                        
                        <p class="primary-role">Investment Analyst</p>                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="member-content">
                    <div class="member-bio">
                        Asaf is an experienced investment analyst with a bachelor's degree in economics and business administration as well as a portfolio management license. Throughout his career, he has held key positions in leading investment companies, including roles as Deputy CEO of Investments and Chief Investment Officer, gaining expertise in managing assets of significant scale. Currently, Asaf focuses on financial and strategic analysis of companies at various stages, conducts in-depth market research, and assesses growth potential. He guides investors in decision-making, prepares comprehensive reports with financial insights, and assists in developing investment strategies. His extensive experience and professional knowledge enable him to provide significant value in the field of investments and financial analysis.                    </div>
                    
                                        
                                        
                                    </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="member-navigation">
                                <a href="?page=team-member&id=ronen-elgali&lang=en" class="navigation-button prev-button" data-tooltip="Previous">
